{
  "inShort": "Behind: the 28-day goal was missed. The devlog claims a build, but nothing accessible demonstrates two islands, tide-driven sailing, co-op or five-player findings. Mia stopped confirming work after week one, leaving only Alex's contribution to the slice confirmed.",
  "discussed": [
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtqehux00k0b9z8hos5tj3s",
      "text": "The public Godot repository matches the task. It supplies demo projects, not evidence of the team's playable slice."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtqehx300k1b9z8kb28kvt0",
      "text": "The animated reference remains done. The linked video's title and thumbnail identify Big Buck Bunny, not sailing footage. Without watching it, the art-style reference cannot be verified."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtqehyr00k2b9z87c8l6gk1",
      "text": "The playtesting article matches the task. It explains testing, but does not document the five players or their findings."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtqehzn00k3b9z854q08ihx",
      "text": "The private design board remains done. Its contents were not checked, so it supplies no verified evidence of the slice."
    }
  ],
  "notDiscussed": [],
  "outsidePlan": [
    "The sprint added no artifacts. The image captioned “The tide out” shows mountains, not the tide loop.",
    "Publishing the prototype devlog satisfies the stage's sole required task. Passing that requirement does not establish the checkpoint goal."
  ],
  "questions": []
}

